      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這該不會是鐵啞鈴牠們對\n我維修的全像傳送梯<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n喜歡得不得了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
