      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D1555E91D1555EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且要是有鐵啞鈴牠們在，\n即使故障了，應該也能很快發現！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E148981662F67099435555E9234726050115728FF0C000A53734F7F6545969C4E86FF0C61C98A724E5F80FD5F885FEB767C73FEFF0100100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好～！我要把牠們全都\n捉起來當我的搭檔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
